lang="en-US" sz="900"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>All inbound and outbound calls are completely recorded. After a complaint is resolved, consumers receive a callback to gather feedback regarding their experience with the call center and field team. Below is a summary of consumer feedback.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="12" name="TextBox 12"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="1003097" y="6173308"/><a:ext cx="5800903" cy="2668264"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1505"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPct val="0"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1075"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>A total of 3,429 surveys were completed, leading to the following insights:</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1505"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPct val="0"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1075"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="232145" lvl="1" indent="-116073" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1505"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPct val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1075"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>An impressive 96.98% of consumers reported satisfaction with how their complaints were resolved, with 2,379 out of 2,453 respondents giving positive feedback.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="232145" lvl="1" indent="-116073" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1505"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPct val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1075"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>84.75% of consumers confirmed that their complaints were closed within the expected turnaround time, with 1,373 out of 1,620 individuals providing affirmative responses.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="232145" lvl="1" indent="-116073" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1505"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPct val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1075"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>A remarkable 99.80% customer satisfaction score was achieved regarding the behavior of agents, with 1,518 out of 1,521 respondents responding positively.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="232145" lvl="1" indent="-116073" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1505"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPct val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1075"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>Likewise, a 99.05% satisfaction score was noted for the first response team's behavior, with 1,246 out of 1,258 giving positive feedback.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1505"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPct val="0"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1075"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1505"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPct val="0"/></a:spcBef></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1075"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>Finally, 99.68% of consumers indicated that the first response team did not request payment, with 1,245 out of 1,249 responding negatively.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>